genetic disease;
(v)
any other condition as may be specified by the Central Supervisory Board;
(4)
no person, being a relative or the husband of the pregnant woman shall seek or encourage the conduct of any pre- natal
diagnostic techniques on her except for the purpose specified in clause (2).
